# An allow-list, not a deny-list. The image needs the Go module, the code and
# the migrations; everything else stays out of the build context, so a local
# secret (.env, demo/.state, an editor's settings) can never reach a layer,
# whatever new file appears in the repository later.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!migrations/

# Tests are compiled only by `go test`; keep their fixtures out as well.
**/testdata/
